'''Crobat''' (Japanese: '''クロバット''' ''Crobat'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of part of the {{TCGP|Triumphant Light}} expansion.

